ul { padding-left: 18px; margin: 4px 0; } li { margin: 4px 0; }
h3 { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; margin: 12px 0 4px; }
code { font: 12px ui-monospace, monospace; }
</style><ul>
<li>Control Mezzanine from the Plex app on your phone or from Plex Web: Mezzanine shows up as a player on your network. Pick it to play a title on the Mac, then pause, seek, skip and change audio or subtitles from the phone. Settings ▸ Playback has the switch. The phone and the Mac need to reach each other on the network (some routers keep Wi-Fi devices apart).</li>
</ul>]]></description>
